          deckDescription: 'Multiple standard 52-card French packs with jokers: 5-7 players use 2 packs, 8-11 use 3 packs, 12 use 4 packs. Jokers (red and black) are added so cards divide evenly with a kitty of 6 or 8. Suits: Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades. Ranks A, K, Q, J, 10 down to 2.',
          suitDescription: 'French suits: Hearts, Diamonds, Clubs, Spades. One suit is named trump each deal by the trump maker.',
          rankDescription: "Standard order A high to 2 low. One rank is trump each deal (same as players' level). Trump rank cards in non-trump suit count as one rank for following.",
          dealPattern: 'Anticlockwise: each player in turn takes one card from the top of the pack until everyone has full hand; 6 or 8 cards remain as kitty.',
